  "text": "Serk Daniel / Daniel Gobena Serk Daniel is considered a pioneer in the Ethiopian literary scene for his ability to write high-stakes, fast-paced political and espionage thrillers. His work is often compared to international thriller icons like Sidney Sheldon because of its cinematic quality and intricate plot twists. Writing Style and Impact Genre Specialist: He"
